    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with **Gunnar Henderson** headlining the daily projections as the primary offensive engine. Boasting an elite 79.74 score, **Gunnar Henderson** occupies the prime leadoff spot against Dean Kremer; the combination of a favorable R/R platoon dynamic (+14%) and the premium leadoff opportunity (+10%) makes him our highest-ceiling asset. **Jacob Wilson** (66.55) and **Kyle Tucker** (63.91) follow closely as secondary anchors. While **Kyle Tucker** faces a left-handed starter in Noah Cameron, his elite base projection keeps him in the starting lineup regardless of platoon splits. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (62.10) also remains a mandatory start, with his #2 order placement providing a necessary floor against Sonny Gray, despite the tough SP_xERA of 3.83.\n\nStrategic benching remains critical to preserving game caps, and **Wade Meckler** (42.35) presented the most difficult decision of the day. While **Wade Meckler** offers a solid base floor and a +10% order bonus for leading off, the L/L matchup against MacKenzie Gore suppressed his ceiling enough for the optimizer to favor the higher potential outputs of our outfield trio. We are monitoring the 31% rain risk in the games involving **Drake Baldwin**, **Dominic Smith**, and **Luis Robert Jr.** closely; should those games face delays, we are prepared to pivot to our bench reserves. While **Luis Robert Jr.** (54.05) is currently slotted to play, his significant negative platoon adjustment (-15%) suggests he is the first candidate to be pulled if weather volatility increases.",
